025 on 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 37% of normal in September to October and 170% in July to August. Grid 26256 had its driest year in 1988 at 56%.</p>"}
